 "disposition": "verify",
 "priority": "low",
 "rationale": "U0158 is a CM coordinator who read the record on shift, on a CM workstation, amid broad same-day multi-patient activity (G1, G2, G5, L1, L2-L31); no personal connection is shown (G4). But no fact gives a job-related purpose and P00773 has no encounter in the period (G3). Neither purpose nor a standalone concern is established, so verify; low priority."
}

