  "How the printed output was handled or where it went (no fact addresses this)."
 ],
 "disposition": "clear",
 "priority": "low",
 "rationale": "Scheduled MED1 nurse (G2) accessed a patient then inpatient in MED1 (G3) from a MED1 workstation (L1; G9) during the shift, with multi-patient activity typical of unit nursing (L2-L31) and many staff touching the same record (L32-L61); no personal link shown (G8). Job-related purpose shown; clear, low priority."
