 "disposition": "verify",
 "priority": "medium",
 "rationale": "U0192 has a departmental link to P03110's upcoming PCP encounter (G8) and the patient was in the ED that morning (G5), but no fact shows a role in that visit; accesses came from ED workstations during a scheduled PCP shift (G2, G9-G11) and included creates/updates (G12). No personal connection is shown; ask the supervisor to confirm purpose."
