{"what_happened": "On 2026-10-22, PCP physician U0192 accessed P01051 six times (11:45-13:17) from PCP devices, performing read, query, update, and create actions (L1-L6; G10, G11, G12), during and after P01051's same-day PCP clinic encounter (G5).",
